detail":"自由現金流 = $1,245M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 55.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 3.02"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":20.02,"default_fair_val":20.02,"premium_pct":149.1,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":9,"pe_forward":7.9,"pb_trailing":2,"pb_forward":1.8,"div_yield":0.19,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":3.61,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":55,"cash_to_assets":19.3,"current_ratio":3.02,"roe":22.8,"roa":10.2,"moat":{"ticker":"SMCIP","period":"2026Q4","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Super Micro Computer (SMCI) 在伺服器與儲存解決方案領域，雖具備一定的技術聲譽，但品牌定價權相對有限。其產品線廣泛，但較難形成如消費品牌般的強勢定價能力。公司主要透過提供客製化、高效能的解決方案來吸引客戶，而非依賴品牌溢價。在快速變化的科技產業中，客戶對價格敏感度較高，競爭對手亦眾多，因此其品牌定價權壁壘尚屬中等，難以支撐顯著的價格調升。","comment_en":"Super Micro Computer (SMCI) has a certain technical reputation in the server and storage solutions sector, but its brand pricing power is relatively limited. While its product lines are extensive, it's difficult to establish the strong pricing ability seen in consumer brands. The company primarily attracts customers by offering customized, high-performance solutions rather than relying on brand premiums. In the rapidly changing technology industry, customers are quite price-sensitive, and competitors are numerous. Therefore, its brand pricing power barrier is moderate, making it difficult to support significant price increases."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"SMCI 在電腦硬體領域的專利佈局相對分散，並非以專利壁壘為主要競爭優勢。雖然公司在特定技術上可能擁有專利，但相較於大型科技公司，其專利組合的廣度與深度尚有差距。產業的快速迭代和技術的開放性，使得專利保護的時效性與絕對性受到挑戰。監管環境對其營運影響較小，但專利本身並未構成一道難以逾越的護城河，競爭對手能透過技術迭代或授權等方式繞過或追趕。","comment_en":"SMCI's patent portfolio in the computer hardware sector is relatively dispersed, and it does not primarily rely on patent barriers as a key competitive advantage. Although the company may hold patents in specific technologies, its patent portfolio's breadth and depth lag behind those of major tech giants. The rapid iteration of the industry and the openness of technology challenge the timeliness and absolute protection of patents. While the regulatory environment has a minor impact on its operations, patents themselves do not form an insurmountable moat. Competitors can circumvent or catch up through technological iteration or licensing."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SMCI 的轉換成本具備一定的強度，主要體現在其高度客製化的解決方案與緊密的客戶整合。一旦客戶採用 SMCI 的伺服器與儲存系統，並將其整合進自身的 IT 架構與工作流程後，更換供應商將涉及大量的重新配置、測試與潛在的軟體相容性問題，耗時耗力。特別是對於追求特定效能與穩定性的企業級客戶而言，這種整合的深度增加了轉換的難度與風險，形成了一定的客戶黏性。","comment_en":"SMCI's switching costs possess a certain strength, primarily reflected in its highly customized solutions and close customer integration. Once customers adopt SMCI's server and storage systems and integrate them into their IT infrastructure and workflows, changing vendors involves significant reconfiguration, testing, and potential software compatibility issues, consuming considerable time and effort. Especially for enterprise clients seeking specific performance and stability, the depth of this integration increases the difficulty and risk of switching, creating a degree of customer stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"SMCI 的業務模式並未顯著體現網絡效應。其產品是獨立的硬體設備，客戶購買後主要用於自身運營，而非透過使用行為來增強產品對其他用戶的價值。雖然其生態系統中的合作夥伴可能存在一定的協同效應，但這與典型的網絡效應（如社交平台或市場平台）有本質區別。客戶的選擇主要基於產品性能、價格和服務，而非其他用戶的使用情況，因此網絡效應壁壘極為薄弱。","comment_en":"SMCI's business model does not significantly exhibit network effects. Its products are standalone hardware devices, and customers primarily use them for their own operations after purchase, rather than enhancing the product's value to other users through their usage. While there might be some synergistic effects among partners in its ecosystem, this is fundamentally different from typical network effects seen in social or marketplace platforms. Customer choices are mainly based on product performance, price, and service, not on the usage patterns of other users, thus the network effect barrier is extremely weak."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SMCI 在伺服器與儲存硬體製造領域，透過其規模化生產和供應鏈管理，建立了顯著的成本優勢。公司專注於模組化設計和高效的生產流程，能夠在採購、製造和物流環節獲得更好的議價能力和效率。這種規模經濟使其能夠提供更具競爭力的價格，同時維持健康的利潤率。對於追求性價比的客戶而言，SMCI 的成本優勢是一項重要的吸引力，並對新進入者構成一定的進入門檻。","comment_en":"In the server and storage hardware manufacturing sector, SMCI has established a significant cost advantage through its scaled production and supply chain management. The company focuses on modular design and efficient production processes, enabling better bargaining power and efficiency in procurement, manufacturing, and logistics. This economies of scale allows it to offer more competitive pricing while maintaining healthy profit margins. For customers seeking cost-effectiveness, SMCI's cost advantage is a crucial attraction and presents a considerable entry barrier for new entrants."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"SMCI 的業務主要集中在科技硬體製造與銷售，並無獨特的地理位置或實體資產構成顯著的護城河。其生產基地和銷售網絡雖然遍佈全球，但這些資產的獨特性和不可複製性不高，競爭對手亦可透過類似佈局來實現。公司並未依賴特定地區的資源或市場准入壁壘，因此在地理資產方面，其護城河相當薄弱。","comment_en":"SMCI's business primarily focuses on technology hardware manufacturing and sales, and it does not possess unique geographical locations or physical assets that constitute a significant moat. While its production bases and sales networks are global, the uniqueness and irreproducibility of these assets are not high, and competitors can achieve similar layouts. The company does not rely on resources from specific regions or market access barriers, thus its moat in terms of geographical assets is quite weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SMCI 在營運效率方面表現出色，尤其體現在其快速的產品開發週期、高效的生產製造以及靈活的供應鏈管理。公司能夠迅速響應市場對新技術和客製化需求的變化，並將產品快速推向市場。其模組化設計和標準化流程有助於降低生產成本和提高產品質量穩定性。這種卓越的營運能力，使其在成本控制和交付速度上優於許多競爭對手，構成了一道堅實的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"SMCI demonstrates outstanding operational efficiency, particularly evident in its rapid product development cycles, efficient manufacturing, and agile supply chain management. The company can quickly respond to market changes in demand for new technologies and customized solutions, bringing products to market swiftly. Its modular design and standardized processes help reduce production costs and improve product quality consistency. This excellent operational capability gives it an edge over many competitors in cost control and delivery speed, forming a solid competitive barrier."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SMCI 的管理層在資本配置方面展現出較為務實和有效的策略。公司在保持穩健現金流的同時，持續投資於研發和擴張產能，以滿足快速增長的需求。其財務結構相對健康，現金儲備充足，負債水平可控。管理層能夠在有機增長和潛在的戰略性收購之間取得平衡，將資本投入到能夠產生高額回報的領域。儘管非傳統意義上的「收費橋」，但其對資本的有效運用，為股東創造了可觀的價值。","comment_en":"SMCI's management demonstrates a pragmatic and effective strategy in capital allocation. While maintaining a solid cash flow, the company continuously invests in R&D and capacity expansion to meet rapidly growing demand. Its financial structure is relatively healthy, with ample cash reserves and controllable debt levels. Management can balance organic growth with potential strategic acquisitions, investing capital in areas that generate high returns. Although not a 'toll bridge' in the traditional sense, its effective use of capital creates considerable value for shareholders."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SMCI 的客戶留存率相對較高，這得益於其提供的客製化解決方案和優質的技術支援服務。一旦客戶與 SMCI 建立合作關係，並將其產品深度整合到業務運營中，由於轉換成本的存在（M3），客戶傾向於維持長期合作。公司積極與客戶溝通，了解其不斷變化的需求，並提供持續的技術升級和支援，進一步鞏固了客戶關係。這種基於深度整合和服務的客戶黏性，構成了穩固的護城河。","comment_en":"SMCI enjoys relatively high customer retention rates, attributable to its customized solutions and quality technical support services. Once customers establish a partnership with SMCI and deeply integrate its products into their business operations, they tend to maintain long-term cooperation due to the existing switching costs (M3). The company actively communicates with clients to understand their evolving needs and provides continuous technical upgrades and support, further solidifying customer relationships. This customer stickiness, based on deep integration and service, forms a stable moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SMCI 的業務模式展現出一定的持久性，主要得益於其在伺服器和儲存硬體領域的專業知識和持續創新能力。儘管科技行業變化迅速，但對高效能運算基礎設施的需求是長期且穩定的。公司透過不斷推出符合市場趨勢（如 AI 伺服器）的新產品，來適應行業變化。其模組化設計和規模化生產的優勢，使其能夠在不同市場週期中保持競爭力，具備較強的業務韌性。","comment_en":"SMCI's business model exhibits a degree of durability, primarily due to its expertise and continuous innovation capabilities in the server and storage hardware sector. Despite the rapid changes in the technology industry, the demand for high-performance computing infrastructure is long-term and stable. The company adapts to industry shifts by consistently launching new products that align with market trends, such as AI servers. Its advantages in modular design and scaled production enable it to remain competitive through various market cycles, demonstrating strong business resilience."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Super Micro Computer (SMCI) 的經濟護城河主要建立在其規模化的成本優勢（M5）、卓越的營運效率（M7）以及較高的客戶轉換成本與留存率（M3, M9）之上。公司在伺服器與儲存硬體領域，透過高效生產和客製化解決方案，成功吸引並留住客戶。然而，其品牌定價權（M1）、專利壁壘（M2）和網絡效應（M4）相對薄弱，使其難以形成絕對的壟斷地位。管理層的資本配置能力（M8）和業務的持久性（M10）為其提供了穩健的基礎。整體而言，SMCI 具備類似「收費橋」的特徵，透過提供關鍵的基礎設施服務，從客戶的持續運營中獲取價值，但其壁壘的強度與廣度尚不及頂尖的科技巨頭。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Super Micro Computer (SMCI)'s economic moat is primarily built upon its scaled cost advantages (M5), excellent operational efficiency (M7), and relatively high customer switching costs and retention rates (M3, M9). In the server and storage hardware sector, the company successfully attracts and retains customers through efficient production and customized solutions. However, its brand pricing power (M1), patent barriers (M2), and network effects (M4) are relatively weak, preventing it from achieving an absolute monopolistic position. Management's capital allocation capabilities (M8) and business durability (M10) provide a solid foundation. Overall, SMCI exhibits characteristics similar to a 'toll bridge,' extracting value from customers' ongoing operations by providing critical infrastructure services, but the strength and breadth of its barriers do not yet match those of top-tier technology giants.","evidenceHash":"0be4f12728d3656f72e40fbe8c3f4998faa16c6904a1052c85383fcb7299a759","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":"staleEvidence","evidenceHash":"0be4f12728d3656f72e40fbe8c3f4998faa16c6904a1052c85383fcb7299a759","currentEvidenceHash":"534a059e75287de2fdc39c0b866e9f55632c078905a5114694963cb00a4f1773"},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-30","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"safe","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-10T08:17:39.794Z","evidenceHash":"5ff5becb3f52a0c4a5c3c5555a8810cd4533f312f1fb8949273730497cfca0d9"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-30","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-10T08:17:39.794Z","evidenceHash":"5ff5becb3f52a0c4a5c3c5555a8810cd4533f312f1fb8949273730497cfca0d9"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SMCIP.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SMCIP.png","website":"http://www.supermicro.com","ceo":"Charles Liang","full_time_employees":"7000","description":"Super Micro Computer, Inc. engages in the distribution and manufacture of information technolog